, "id": "2115869925558673681", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We live in a Weird Time in GPUs.\n\nEveryone says there's a GPU shortage.\nMeanwhile, GPUs sit in racks waiting for power.\n\nChip companies want to be clouds.\nClouds want to be chip companies.\n\nHyperscalers are building their own AI chips.\nAnd still buying every NVIDIA GPU they can", "url": "https://x.com/waiting4ragi/status/2115869925558673681"}, {"author_id": "84841519", "created_at": "2026-10-28T00:14:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115235638345703932"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/T0L9lPu6wT", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TechFieldDay/status/2115235638345703932/video/1", "media_key": "7_2115235608461291520", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/T0L9lPu6wT"}]}, "id": "2115235638345703932", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 222, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "The era of focusing solely on massive GPU training clusters is over—the real enterprise networking battlefield has officially shifted to distributed inference. \n\nFor this takeaway, Tom Hollingsworth discusses how disaggregated inference architectures are transforming data center https://t.co/T0L9lPu6wT", "url": "https://x.com/TechFieldDay/status/2115235638345703932"}, {"author_id": "32563750", "created_at": "2026-10-28T15:17:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115463043832222093", "2115463656951456052"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/GavinSBaker/st…", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/GavinSBaker/status/2112901769517003073", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/UZL7P7Z9pb"}]}, "id": "2115463043832222093", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "21129017695