search on a remote GPU cluster lately. Claude kept telling me my research idea wouldn't work.\n\nI asked if the implementation matched the upstream code. It confidently said yes.\n\nThen I opened W&amp;B and https://t.co/iPAXQ0LIxp", "url": "https://x.com/HorizonWind2004/status/2115890647764742379"}, {"author_id": "2115672486767693824", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115896452450771126"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Explore PyTorch 2.15, featuring a rewritten NCCL backend by default, NVGEMM decode improvements, FP8 on Apple Silicon, and expanded platform support.", "display_url": "pytorch.org/blog/pytorch-2…", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://pytorch.org/blog/pytorch-2-15-release-blog/", "images": [{"height": 628, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115500780749033472/i5voVjQH?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115500780749033472/i5voVjQH?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 244, "status": 200, "title": "PyTorch 2.15 Release Blog - PyTorch", "unwound_url": "https://pytorch.org/blog/pytorch-2-15-release-blog/", "url": "https://t.co/u4BPKGSYwD"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/MNLu7IhLJe", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Alanogrok/status/2115896452450771126/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115882726306025472", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/MNLu7IhLJe"}]}, "id": "2115896452450771126", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PyTorch 2.15 makes its rewritten NCCL backend the default, with flight-recorder dumps when a collective hangs.\n\nAt cluster scale, time spent finding a stalled rank belongs in the training budget. Diagnosis costs GPU-hours too.\n\nImage: PyTorch.\nhttps://t.co/u4BPKGSYwD https://t.co/MNLu7IhLJe", "url": "https://x.com/Alanogrok/status/2115896452450771126"}, {"author_id": "1859224258448396288", "created_at": 